     [38;5;153muser_id[39m, and leave [38;5;153m/users[39m as it is. Clients move to v2 when they're ready.
  2. [1mReturn both fields for a while.[0m Send [38;5;153muserId[39m and [38;5;153muser_id[39m side by side, then remove [38;5;153muserId[39m once every consumer has
     switched.
  3. [1mRename in place anyway.[0m This only makes sense if you know all three consumers can switch at the same moment.

